# tally 2.3.1 S23 (L §4.2 age_months: the largest n with add_months(b, n) <= d): in the calendar's last month,
# 0, since a month past 9999-12 is later than every d. Before: RUN-LIMIT a day passes 9999-12-31 (#250).
=== age_last.tally
model age_last
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "probe"
input b: date
input d: date
input b2: date

ask a_last: age_months(b, d)
ask a_prev: age_months(b2, d)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  b = 9999-12-01 "s"
  d = 9999-12-27 "s"
  b2 = 9999-10-31 "s"
=== expect
a_last: 0
  cut 2026-06-30
a_prev: 1
  cut 2026-06-30
